<title>INDIA: India govt ad hoc t-bill within ceiling, says RBI.</title>
<headline>India govt ad hoc t-bill within ceiling, says RBI.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian government's net issue of ad hoc treasury bills stood at 39.65 billion rupees on March 21, 1997 over the March 31, 1996 level, the Reserve Bank of India said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the net issue of ad hocs as on March 14, 1997, was 64.10 billion rupees.</p>
<p>&quot;Thus, the net issue of ad hocs has been below the 'within-the-year' ceiling of 90.0 billion rupees,&quot; RBI said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
